# SSH Public Key Placeholder
# ============================================================
# The actual az700demos / az700demos.pub key pair is gitignored
# and must be generated locally before deploying.
#
# To generate your own key pair:
#
#   ssh-keygen -t rsa -b 4096 -f az700demos -C "az700-demo"
#
# This produces:
#   az700demos      <- private key (NEVER commit this)
#   az700demos.pub  <- public key  (NEVER commit this)
#
# The public key value is used in main.parameters.json:
#   "nvaSshPublicKey": "<paste contents of az700demos.pub here>"
#
# Only required when deployRouteServer = true.
# ============================================================
